flowchart TD
    A[Validated input] --> B{Mode}
    B -->|triage| T[Collect metadata]
    T --> TN[Notify]
    TN --> TS[Triage succeeded]
    B -->|containment| C[Collect metadata]
    C --> E[Snapshot evidence]
    E --> D{dry_run?}
    D -->|yes| P[Plan quarantine and isolation]
    P --> PN[Dry-run notification]
    PN --> PS[Containment planned]
    D -->|no| AP[Human approval wait]
    AP -->|APPROVE| Q[Ensure ruleless quarantine SG]
    Q --> I[Isolate network interfaces]
    I --> N[Notify]
    N --> CS[Containment succeeded]
    AP -->|DENY / timeout| CX[Stop without containment]
    B -->|rollback| R[Validate and plan rollback]
    R --> RD{dry_run?}
    RD -->|yes| RP[Rollback planned]
    RD -->|no| RAP[Human rollback approval]
    RAP -->|APPROVE| RR[Restore original SGs]
    RR --> RN[Notify]
    RN --> RS[Rollback succeeded]
    RAP -->|DENY / timeout| RX[Stop without rollback]
